"Grey-eyed, graceful and slim as a knife, mounted on a great black destrier "
"and clad head to heel in black leather, moleskin and fine supple ringmail. "
"Less than half a year in the Watch, and no one doubted he was ready for his "
"command. His wardrobe was, at least."
